{"t":"CMS","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"CMS Energy Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","employees":8350,"hq":"Jackson, MI, United States","website":"https://www.cmsenergy.com","summary_en":"CMS Energy Corporation operates as an energy company primarily in Michigan. The company operates through three segments: Electric Utility; Gas Utility; and NorthStar Clean Energy. The Electric Utility segment is involved in the generation, purchase, distribution, and sale of electricity. This segment generates electricity through coal, wind, gas, renewable energy, oil, and nuclear sources. Its distribution system comprises 263 miles of high-voltage distribution overhead lines; 4 miles of high-voltage distribution underground lines; 4,619 miles of high-voltage distribution overhead lines; 18 miles of high-voltage distribution underground lines; 82,854 miles of electric distribution overhead lines; 10,027 miles of underground distribution lines; and 1,102 substations. The Gas Utility segment engages in the purchase, transmission, storage, distribution, and sale of natural gas, which includes 2,337 miles of transmission lines; 14 gas storage fields; 28,433 miles of distribution mains; and 8 compressor stations. The NorthStar Clean Energy segment is involved in the independent power production and marketing, including the development and operation of renewable generation. The company serves 1.9 million electric and 1.8 million gas customers, including residential, commercial, and diversified industrial customers. The company was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Jackson, Michigan.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"CMS Energy Corporation은 주로 미시간에서 에너지 회사로 운영됩니다. 회사는 세 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다: 전기 유틸리티; 가스 유틸리티; 및 NorthStar 청정 에너지. 전력사업부문은 전력의 생산, 구매, 배전, 판매를 영위합니다. 이 부문은 석탄, 풍력, 가스, 재생 가능 에너지, 석유 및 원자력을 통해 전기를 생산합니다. 배전 시스템은 263마일에 달하는 고전압 배전 가공선로 구성되어 있습니다. 4마일의 고전압 배전 지하선; 4,619마일의 고전압 배전 가공선; 18마일의 고전압 배전 지하선; 82,854마일의 배전 가공선; 10,027마일의 지하 배전선; 변전소는 1,102개이다. 가스 유틸리티 부문은 2,337마일의 송전선을 포함하는 천연가스의 구매, 전송, 저장, 유통 및 판매에 종사합니다. 가스 저장 구역 14개; 28,433마일의 배전망; 8개의 압축기 스테이션. NorthStar 청정 에너지 부문은 재생 가능 발전의 개발 및 운영을 포함하여 독립적인 전력 생산 및 마케팅에 참여하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 주거용, 상업용 및 다양한 산업 고객을 포함하여 190만 명의 전기 고객과 180만 명의 가스 고객에게 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 1987년에 설립되었으며 미시간주 잭슨에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":69.55,"mcap":21812664320.0,"pe":24.839287,"fpe":16.782087,"peg":2.4941,"ps":2.4303806,"pb":2.2953796,"ev_ebitda":13.577,"div":3.3,"beta":0.297,"hi52":80.36,"lo52":62.29},"fin":{"rev":8974999552.0,"rev_g":0.08,"eps_g":-0.579,"gross":0.40758,"op":0.28447,"net":0.09716,"roe":0.05313,"fcf":-2069750016.0,"cash":451000000.0,"debt":20206999552.0,"de":196.28,"eps":2.8,"feps":4.1443},"own":{"short":0.00029999999,"inst":1.0417199,"insider":0.00546},"analyst":{"n":13,"mean":73.84615,"median":73.0,"high":78.0,"low":68.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.3125,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":4,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":4,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":4,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-28","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":73.0,"priorPriceTarget":79.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-22","Firm":"HSBC","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":69.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":73.0,"priorPriceTarget":77.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-19","Firm":"BMO Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":76.0,"priorPriceTarget":73.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-16","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade